Z||000004||terryk||02-19-2001||01:22 PM||||The Spintech is a 331SC. 2.5" in dual 2" out. If you want it a bit louder, get the 333SC. 2.5" in a dual 2.5" out.<P>I got the 331SC. $140 out the door including CA tax.<P>The muffler is 13x9x4" or about 1" longer than the stock Fiero.<P>The best part is that you can have it in a few days.<P>TK||||reg||1
Z||000005||Bruce||02-19-2001||04:13 PM||||I bought the muffler from Chris West and I'm very happy with the fit and performance.||||reg||1
